      },
      {
         "step": 2,
         "text": "The slope is s'(2) = (3 - 12) / 25 = -9/25.",
         "mathjson": [
            "Rational",
            -9,
            25
         ]
      },
      {
         "step": 3,
         "text": "The height is s(2) = 6/5, so the point of tangency is (2, 6/5).",
